# context for ui/Dockerfile only (`docker buildx build -f ui/Dockerfile .` from the
# repo root). keeper/ and monitor/ build with their own directory as the context
# and never read this file. a whitelist: without it the hardhat tree (1.47 MB
# lockfile, audit pdfs) and any local keeper/.env transit the builder every build.
*
!ui/**
!keeper/src/**
!keeper/package.json

# never, even inside the whitelisted dirs
**/.env*
**/node_modules
ui/build
ui/.svelte-kit
ui/*.db
ui/*.db-wal
ui/*.db-shm
